 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！第八集，我们认识了身体。今天，我们凑近一点，仔细看看自己的脸。"
    },
    {
     "en": "face"
    },
    {
     "zh": "脸。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:face",
    "focus:face"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "每天照镜子，看到的就是自己的脸："
    },
    {
     "en": "face"
    },
    {
     "en": "Wash your face."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:eye",
    "edge:face>eye",
    "focus:eye"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脸上亮晶晶的，是眼睛："
    },
    {
     "en": "eye"
    },
    {
     "zh": "两只眼睛：",
     "cue": [
      "plural:eye"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:ear",
    "edge:face>ear",
    "focus:ear"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脸的两边，是耳朵："
    },
    {
     "en": "ear"
    },
    {
     "zh": "两只耳朵：",
     "cue": [
      "plural:ear"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "ears"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:nose",
    "edge:face>nose",
    "focus:nose"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脸的正中间，是鼻子："
    },
    {
     "en": "nose"
    },
    {
     "en": "Touch your nose."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:mouth",
    "edge:face>mouth",
    "focus:mouth"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "鼻子下面，是嘴巴："
    },
    {
     "en": "mouth"
    },
    {
     "en": "Open your mouth."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:tooth",
    "edge:mouth>tooth",
    "focus:tooth"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "嘴巴里，有一颗一颗白白的牙齿："
    },
    {
     "en": "tooth"
    },
    {
     "zh": "很多颗牙齿可不加 s，而是像第八集的脚一样，把两个 o 变成两个 e："
    },
    {
     "en": "teeth",
     "cue": [
      "plural:tooth"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "foot, feet."
    },
    {
     "en": "tooth, teeth."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:tongue",
    "edge:mouth>tongue",
    "focus:tongue"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "嘴巴里会动、能尝出味道的，是舌头："
    },
    {
     "en": "tongue"
    },
    {
     "zh": "小提示：它最后的 u 和 e，都不发音。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:chin",
    "edge:face>chin",
    "focus:chin"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脸的最下面，是下巴："
    },
    {
     "en": "chin"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:throat",
    "edge:mouth>throat",
    "focus:throat"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "吃下去的东西，要经过喉咙："
    },
    {
     "en": "throat"
    },
    {
     "zh": "开头的 t h，舌尖要轻轻放在牙齿中间。"
    },
    {
     "en": "I have a sore throat."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:chest",
    "edge:throat>chest",
    "focus:chest"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "喉咙再往下，是胸口。心脏就在这里，扑通扑通地跳："
    },
    {
     "en": "chest"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:brain",
    "edge:face>brain",
    "focus:brain"
   ],
   "parts": [
